            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有 Wi-Fi 或以太网接口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "disruption.wifi.v3" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi only accepts a new address while disconnected, so MACDancer disconnects %@ first. macOS does not rejoin by itself after that: when the change is done, choose your network in the Wi-Fi menu. If Private Wi-Fi Address is on for that network, macOS may swap in its own address when you rejoin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wi-Fi 只有在断开时才接受新地址，所以 MACDancer 会先断开 %@。断开后 macOS 不会自动重连：修改完成后，请在 Wi-Fi 菜单里选择你的网络。如果这个网络开启了“私有 Wi-Fi 地址”，重新加入时 macOS 可能会换成它自己的地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "disruption.wired" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ is in use. Its connection may drop for a moment while macOS applies the new address."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 正在使用中。macOS 应用新地址时，连接可能会短暂中断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
